import{_ as t,o as i,c as s,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 295 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 295 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency","no":295,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Setting Self-Consistency","Quantitative Assessment","Law-First Axiom"],"related":["97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table","29-Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0295_模块2-遮天-设定自洽度评估.md","filePath":"en/0295_模块2-遮天-设定自洽度评估.md"}'),o={name:"en/0295_模块2-遮天-设定自洽度评估.md"};function a(r,e,l,c,d,h){return i(),s("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-295-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-medium-low-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">Entry 295 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-295-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-medium-low-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 295 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Setting Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 8) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 29, 14</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turning-feels-off-into-a-scorable-metric" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Turning &quot;feels off&quot; into a scorable metric <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turning-feels-off-into-a-scorable-metric" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Turning &quot;feels off&quot; into a scorable metric&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the law-first axiom requires setting self-consistency over plot convenience. This entry borrows Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System to give Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; setting self-consistency a structured quantification, rather than staying at the impression level of &quot;I feel late-stage it collapsed.&quot; Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Energy waste brought by low self-consistency:</p><ul><li>Every self-contradictory setting requires readers to mentally patch, cognitive load shifted to the audience</li><li>World-view expands larger, rule patches pile more, eventually the author himself can no longer remember the previous text</li><li>Adaptations, fan works, derivatives hard to expand due to unstable baseline; IP assets depreciate</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Narrative regression caused by low self-consistency:</p><ol><li><strong>Early world credibility</strong>: Sea of Wheels, Dao Palace era world relatively credible; readers willing to invest</li><li><strong>Mid-stage rule loosening</strong>: quasi-emperor, emperor stage rules start to elasticize</li><li><strong>Late credibility bankruptcy</strong>: Red-Dust Immortal, trilogy-linkage stage, readers already &quot;give up believing&quot;; narrative degrades from epic to power fantasy This is a self-consistency decay curve sliding from &quot;credible&quot; to &quot;not credible.&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind low self-consistency is predation on readers&#39; &quot;credence resources&quot;:</p><ul><li>World rules repeatedly modified is equivalent to repeatedly collecting reader trust deposits</li><li>Once readers discover rules are not credible, they no longer invest emotion in any new setting</li><li>Protagonist halo becomes universal explanation, &quot;why can he&quot; — &quot;because he is the protagonist&quot; — this is fundamental predation on setting seriousness</li></ul><p>Quantifying self-consistency must also distinguish two kinds: one is &quot;internal self-consistency,&quot; i.e., the world-view internally does not fight itself; the other is &quot;reader-predictability self-consistency,&quot; i.e., readers can infer what happens next from existing rules. Shrouding-the-Heavens early has both self-consistency acceptable; late both collapse — internal settings contradict each other, readers completely give up prediction. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law-first axiom simultaneously guarantees both: law anchoring keeps internal non-fighting; clear thresholds let readers calculate. These two self-consistencies combined is truly high-self-consistency world-view.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Self-Consistency Dimension</th><th>Shrouding Score</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Baseline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Realm-rule stability</td><td>Low (late inflation)</td><td>High (nine-realm cap)</td></tr><tr><td>Total-resource constraint</td><td>Medium-low (inflates with plot)</td><td>High (develop increments, not grab stock)</td></tr><tr><td>Karma timeline</td><td>Low (trilogy fights)</td><td>High (era division master table fixed)</td></tr><tr><td>Character power boundaries</td><td>Low (whoever needed wins)</td><td>High (law-anchored)</td></tr><tr><td>Cross-work consistency</td><td>Low</td><td>High (version maintenance notes)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Composite self-consistency</strong></td><td><strong>Medium-low</strong></td><td><strong>High</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: score Shrouding item by item on the table&#39;s five dimensions, build a self-consistency radar chart</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: compare the same world-view&#39;s score decay across &quot;early,&quot; &quot;mid,&quot; &quot;late&quot; three stages</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: which dimension loses points fastest — conclusion is realm rules and timeline</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: self-consistency decay mainly occurs after the protagonist enters quasi-emperor, consistent with the &quot;plot kidnaps setting&quot; hypothesis</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong> (quantitative score about 40% of Heng Yuan Zhou baseline)</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: medium</strong>. Self-consistency decays with Ye Fan&#39;s leveling, fluctuates with oligarchic-group narration</li></ul><p>Self-consistency assessment should also include a &quot;cross-reader consistency&quot; dimension: after different readers finish the same work, is their understanding of the world-view consistent? Late Shrouding trilogy, three readers may reach three different conclusions on the same character&#39;s strength; this is cross-reader consistency collapse. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s document system precisely pursues cross-reader consistency — any reader looking up the same setting gets the same answer. This consistency is not academic fastidiousness, but the precondition for the world-view to be discussable and co-buildable.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cognitive load shifted, IP assets depreciate</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: predating reader credence resources</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo self-consistency medium-high, Shrouding medium-low — both protagonist narration, Shrouding sacrifices settings for a larger leveling幅度</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: self-consistency assessment must cover Myriad Ranks and supporting characters, not only protagonist combat power</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: low-self-consistency world-view cannot serve as cross-multiverse baseline</li></ul><p>It needs adding that self-consistency should also assess &quot;do rules apply equally to the weak?&quot; Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; rules are hard on ordinary cultivators — hundred-year soul rings, thousand-year Dao hearts, violators die; but soft on Ye Fan and the oligarchic group — they can comprehend, luck out, cross-tier. This two-tier rule nature is low self-consistency&#39;s most hidden and fatal manifestation. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law-anchored authority benefiting all beings is precisely to cancel this two-tier nature: rules apply equally to anchors and ordinary cultivators, not elasticizing by person&#39;s strength. This is truly high-self-consistency world-view.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Self-consistency is not &quot;readers nitpicking,&quot; but the world-view&#39;s credit rating. Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; late problem is not that it is not written hot-bloodedly enough, but that its credit bankrupted. Heng Yuan Zhou would rather write one fewer realm tier than let rules always be checkable, credible, calculable.</p><p>Self-consistency is not an academic score, but the world-view&#39;s credit rating. Late Shrouding-the-Heavens credit bankrupt; readers did not give up because settings are complex, but because they discovered rules can be modified at any time. What Heng Yuan Zhou must do is build credit from day one.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · setting self-consistency assessment described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./292_模块2-遮天-境界膨胀批判.html">Entry 292 · Realm Inflation</a> · <a href="./294_模块2-遮天-剧情绑架设定案例.html">Entry 294 · Plot Kidnapping</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
